{
    "title": "TKS 10 Noir Watch Face",
    "description": "An elegant, analog Wear OS watch face with face on animation that pairs well with formal outfits.\r\n\r\n* Not suitable for rectangular smart watches\r\n*Supports Wear OS 4 and Wear OS 5 Only.\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n- 3 Clock digits styles: animated, static, and off.\r\n- 28 color options, all of which has true black background.\r\n- Battery and steps progress bars.\r\n- Customizable style: choose between gradient and solid style for the \r\n   indicators, digits, and text. on/off style for the seconds hand and \r\n   index.\r\n- Simple AOD mode, with less than 2% pixel on ratio.\r\n- 4 Customizable Complications.\r\n- 4 Customizable App shortcuts.\r\n\r\n\r\nInstalling the watch face:\r\nDuring watch face installation, keep your watch selected. You can skip installing the phone app - the watch face should work just fine on its own.\r\n\r\nUsing the watch face:\r\n1- Tap and hold on your watch display.\r\n2- Swipe all watch faces to the right\r\n3- Tap \"+\" and find the installed watch face in this list.\r\n\r\n\r\n*Important note for pixel watch users:\r\nThere's a pixel watch rendering issue that sometimes causes the battery and steps counters to freeze specifically after you customize the watch face on your pixel watch. this can be fixed by switching to a different watch face and then back to this one.\r\n\r\nRun into any issues or need a hand? We're happy to help! Just send us an email at dev.tinykitchenstudios@gmail.com\r\n\r\nFollow us at instagram.com/tiny.kitchen.studios/",
    "descriptionHTML": "An elegant, analog Wear OS watch face with face on animation that pairs well with formal outfits.<br><br>* Not suitable for rectangular smart watches<br>*Supports Wear OS 4 and Wear OS 5 Only.<br><br>FEATURES:<br>- 3 Clock digits styles: animated, static, and off.<br>- 28 color options, all of which has true black background.<br>- Battery and steps progress bars.<br>- Customizable style: choose between gradient and solid style for the <br>   indicators, digits, and text. on/off style for the seconds hand and <br>   index.<br>- Simple AOD mode, with less than 2% pixel on ratio.<br>- 4 Customizable Complications.<br>- 4 Customizable App shortcuts.<br><br><br>Installing the watch face:<br>During watch face installation, keep your watch selected. You can skip installing the phone app - the watch face should work just fine on its own.<br><br>Using the watch face:<br>1- Tap and hold on your watch display.<br>2- Swipe all watch faces to the right<br>3- Tap &quot;+&quot; and find the installed watch face in this list.<br><br><br>*Important note for pixel watch users:<br>There&#39;s a pixel watch rendering issue that sometimes causes the battery and steps counters to freeze specifically after you customize the watch face on your pixel watch. this can be fixed by switching to a different watch face and then back to this one.<br><br>Run into any issues or need a hand? We&#39;re happy to help! Just send us an email at dev.tinykitchenstudios@gmail.com<br><br>Follow us at instagram.com/tiny.kitchen.studios/",
